==A Night at the Theatre==
===After each wave===
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' You fought well. Now, let us move on. We have to reach Verzik so that I can extract her memories.
* {{tact|end}}

===The Maiden of Sugadinti===
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' The Maiden of Sugadinti. Such an ironic name.
* '''Player:''' What do you know about her?
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' Not much more than you probably know yourself. Hers is a tragic tale of misguided hope.
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' You might find it useful to know that she's a powerful user of magic. Unsurprisingly, blood magic is her specialism. I hear she also has a habit of using nylocas to further increase her power.
* '''Player:''' Good to know. Thanks.
* {{tact|end}}

===Pestilent Bloat===
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' The Pestilent Bloat. What a disgusting monstrosity.
* '''Player:''' What even is it?
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' Nothing fancier than some crude necromancy. Still, that doesn't mean it's not dangerous. Don't even try to take it head on. Wait for the perfect moment and attack while it is weak.
* '''Player:''' Will do.
* {{tact|end}}

===Nylocas===
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' Nylocas... I've always hated nylocas.
* '''Player:''' You've encountered nylocas before?
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' Some types. Alone they're not overly dangerous, but you'll never encounter them alone. Their power is in numbers.
* '''Player:''' So how do I overcome that?
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' Different variants have different weaknesses. Prioritise your targets, and ensure you use the right weaponry against them.
* {{tact|end}}

===Sotetseg===
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' Sotetseg. One of the greater mysteries of this Theatre.
* '''Player:''' How so?
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' He's some sort of modified dark beast. No dark beasts have ever been encountered in Morytania, so who knows how the vampyres got him here. Perhaps he is not of this world at all...
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' Be careful, for he has a strong affinity with the shadow realm. He will almost certainly use it against you. Expect the unexpected.
* '''Player:''' Unexpected?
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' Yes. Survivors of the Theatre have spoken of some sort of strange shadowy maze.
* '''Player:''' I see...
* {{tact|end}}

===Xarpus===
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' The once great King of the yarasa. This prison is such a sad end for Xarpus.
* '''Player:''' You feel sorry for him?
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' Death would be preferable to a life of imprisonment. The Theatre is a testament to that.
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' Anyway, we are close now. Defeat Xarpus, and the path to Verzik is clear.
* '''Player:''' Any advice?
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' He will attempt to power himself up before he fights. Try and stop that where you can. Once the fight begins, be careful of his highly poisonous attacks.
* '''Player:''' Okay thanks.
* {{tact|end}}

===Verzik Vitur===
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' You fought well. Now, only Verzik awaits. Remember, you must fully defeat her for me to have a chance to extract her memories. Let us proceed once you are ready.
* {{tact|end}}

==The final memory==
===Talking to the Mysterious Stranger after completing the Theatre of Blood===
* '''Mysterious Stranger:''' You again. What can I do for you?
* {{tselect|Select an Option}}
* {{topt|Did you manage to get any useful memories from Verzik?}}
** '''Player:''' Did you manage to get any useful memories from Verzik?
** '''Mysterious Stranger:''' Yes and no. I have a memory that I believe has answers for us. However, it is not Verzik's memory.
** '''Player:''' What?
** '''Mysterious Stranger:''' I think it's best if I just show you.
** '''Mysterious Stranger:''' Prepare yourself!
** {{qact|The memory plays. Verzik, flying from the ceiling, appears.}}
** '''Verzik Vitur:''' Doctor... are you still there?
** '''Vulcan Orvoros:''' I'm right here, my lady. I was just finishing my notes.
** '''Verzik Vitur:''' I feel... I feel... wrong.
** '''Vulcan Orvoros:''' My lady, as I've already said, we really should take you to my surgery in Darkmeyer. Whatever that nylocas did, it was no normal bite.
** '''Verzik Vitur:''' No! This is my home! You will not take me!
** '''Vulcan Orvoros:''' I understand. My notes are finished now. I will leave you in peace.
** '''Verzik Vitur:''' Peace? Yes...
** {{qact|The doctor leaves.}}
** '''Verzik Vitur:''' Doctor... It's... inside me!
** '''Vulcan Orvoros:''' My lady?
** '''Verzik Vitur:''' I can feel it! Help me!
** {{qact|Verzik explodes and blood splatters about. In her place, the Nylocas Queen and many nylocas appear.}}
** '''Vulcan Orvoros:''' What...
** '''Nylocas Queen:''' Come... Come my pretties...
** '''Nylocas Queen:''' Destroy the witness... Let us dine on his corpse!
** '''Vulcan Orvoros:''' No!
** '''Nylocas Queen:''' The rule of the vampyres is over... The rule of the nylocas has begun...
** {{qact|As the cutscene fades to black, spiders can be heard attacking the doctor, killing him. The memory ends here.}}
** '''Player:''' Verzik... She died!
** '''Mysterious Stranger:''' We feared the worst, but we never anticipated something like this.
** '''Player:''' But does this mean... the Verzik in the Theatre...
** '''Mysterious Stranger:''' ...is really just that nylocas in disguise. We must inform my master at once.
** '''Player:''' Your master? So these associates you've been going on about... they don't actually exist do they?
** '''Mysterious Stranger:''' They do not. My master preferred that I keep his involvement a secret, but I feel you are now trusted enough to meet him.
** '''Player:''' Meet him? Where?
** '''Mysterious Stranger:''' In a similar way to how my kind can relive our memories, we can also communicate across great distances.
** '''Mysterious Stranger:''' Another of my kind is with my master. Through the two of us, you will be able to speak with him.
** '''Player:''' Okay, I think I understand.
** '''Mysterious Stranger:''' Prepare yourself!
** {{qact|The player and the stranger enter their mind threshold.}}
** '''Player:''' Well this is weird.
** '''Mysterious Stranger:''' It can take some getting used to. Now, I will contact my master and inform him of what we have discovered. Once I am done, I expect he will want to speak with you.
** '''Mysterious Stranger:'''
** '''Mysterious Stranger:''' There. Now, when I next speak, it will be my voice you hear. However, the words are from my master.
** '''Player:''' Okay...
** '''Mysterious Master:''' Greetings my child. It is good that we are finally able to speak, for you have done a great service to me and my disciples.
** '''Player:''' It would be nicer if we could speak in person.
** '''Mysterious Master:''' If that were possible, we would make it so. There are many constraints upon us. Still, these constraints are often to our benefit.
** '''Player:''' How so?
** '''Mysterious Master:''' We share many common enemies, you and I. Enemies that infest Hallowvale like a disease.
** '''Mysterious Master:''' By remaining far away from this disease, I keep us all safer. Instead, my disciples act as my eyes, ears, and hands upon Gielinor. They are the harbingers of my will.
** '''Player:''' So where are you then?
** '''Mysterious Master:''' Home.
** '''Player:''' Right... And what's your connection to Verzik?
** '''Mysterious Master:''' She was an old foe. We will not weep for her demise.
** '''Player:''' What about this nylocas that's replaced her?
** '''Mysterious Master:''' A concerning development. However, you have gathered all that we need to overcome it when the time is right.
** '''Player:''' When the time is right?
** '''Mysterious Master:''' When the time is right.
** '''Player:''' So there's nothing further for us to do now?
** '''Mysterious Master:''' No. For now, we must wait. But once again, you have my thanks. My disciple will ensure you are suitably rewarded. Know that you are now a friend of Sugadinti.
** {{qact|The player returns to Ver Sinhaza.}}
** {{tact|end}}
