* {{tselect|Start the Clock Tower quest?}}
* {{topt|Yes.}}
** '''Player:''' OK old monk, what can I do?
** '''Brother Kojo:''' Oh, thank you kindly! In the cellar below, you'll find four cogs. They're too heavy for me, but you should be able to carry them one at a time.
** '''Brother Kojo:''' I know one goes on each floor... but I can't exactly remember which goes where specifically. Oh well, I'm sure you can figure it out fairly easily.
