==Drinking from bottle==
* {{tselect|Start Crab Quest?}}
* {{topt|Yes.}}
** {{mes|Against your better judgement, you pick up the bottle and take a sip...}}
** {{mes|...and immediately black out.}}
** '''Player:''' {{overhead|Urrrrrgh!}}
** '''Player:''' I feel like I've just been kicked off Entrana.
** '''Player:''' Hey there, little guy! Aww, look at you! You're so cute!
** '''Crab:''' No, I'm not.
** '''Player:''' Aaaaaaaaaah! You can talk!
** '''Crab:''' Of course I can! I'm ugly, not stupid.
** '''Player:''' Wait, what? You're not ugly! You're adorable! What makes you think you're ugly?
** '''Crab:''' ...
** '''Crab:''' I stand corrected. I am here getting therapy from a huge fleshy thing I just found on the beach, which quite frankly I should have run from. I must also be stupid.
** '''Player:''' Hey now, you shouldn't be so harsh on yourself. Even dubious decisions can turn out well. For instance, I just drank from this random bottle I found, which sounds like a terrible idea.
** '''Player:''' And, to be honest, feels like a terrible idea too. Urgh. I now have a pounding headache...
** '''Crab:''' I'm still waiting for the bit where this wasn't a terrible idea.
** '''Player:''' I got to meet you!
** '''Crab:''' I'm STILL waiting for the bit where this wasn't a terrible idea.
** '''Crab:''' Hang on, if you thought it was going to be such a terrible idea, why did you even do it?
** '''Player:''' I felt... strangely compelled to? It's hard to explain. I just had the conviction that I needed to do it, no matter the consequences.
** {{tcond|If the player has NPC attack options enabled:}}
*** '''Player:''' It happens sometimes... I feel the urge to do something daft, like attacking someone I wanted to talk to. Sometimes I can resist it, and sometimes I can't.
*** {{tact|continues}}
** {{tcond|If the player has NPC attack options disabled:}}
*** '''Player:''' It happens sometimes... I feel the urge to do something daft, like running in the complete opposite direction to where I wanted to go. Sometimes I can resist it, and sometimes I can't.
*** {{tact|continues}}
** '''Crab:''' Something tells me that I shouldn't take advice from you.
** '''Player:''' Sure, I make mistakes, but learning from mistakes makes you wiser!
** '''Crab:''' Are you learning, though? Because I am learning nothing from this.
** '''Crab:''' Listen, you can rest here for a little while, but we'll be needing the beach back very soon for the ceremony.
** '''Player:''' The ceremony? What ceremony?
** '''Crab:''' You're not from around here, are you? Very well, then, I will explain.
** '''Crab:''' Every year, my kin comes down from the heights and gathers on the beach. There, we perform the ceremonial dance and build sand nests to try and find a mate.
** '''Player:''' Wait... Is this literally a dating site?
** '''Crab:''' ...
** '''Crab:''' Yes. And every...
** {{tbox|The crab painstakingly counts up to 16 on his claws.}}
** '''Crab:''' 100 years, the turnout is significantly bigger. Legends say that they're echoes of a time where our population boomed. One of those ceremonies will happen in a couple of days.
** '''Player:''' Sounds like it's going to be quite the party!
** '''Crab:''' Yeah...
** '''Player:''' You don't sound convinced.
** '''Crab:''' Let's say I've not had a good experience in the past. I... don't really want to talk about it.
** '''Crab:''' If only I could be a ceremonial leader, then maybe...
** '''Player:''' A ceremonial leader? What do they do?
** '''Crab:''' Ceremonial leaders are the ones performing the ceremonial rhythm. Without them, the dance isn't synchronised and the ceremony descends into chaos.
** '''Crab:''' That usually results in some crabs complaining loudly about how much they paid to be there.
** '''Player:''' Wait... You have to pay to attend?
** '''Crab:''' For the most part, no, but if you want to avoid any risk of being trampled, there are sections of the beach which are more exclusive. Personally, I think being mildly trampled is part of the experience.
** '''Player:''' I see. Anyhow, why do you wish to become a ceremonial leader?
** '''Crab:''' Ceremonial leaders are respected and looked up to as long as they lead the ceremony successfully. It's not usually my thing to stand in front of others, but maybe that's what it takes.
** '''Player:''' What it takes for what?
** '''Crab:''' To finally be seen...
** {{tbox|The crab's voice trails off as he looks up towards the trees and his face, somehow, appears to turn redder.}}
** '''Player:''' Er... How does one become a ceremonial leader, then?
** '''Crab:''' You need an instrument. Usually either seashell or coconut, but good seashells can be hard to find. 
** '''Crab:''' Say... Even though you only have 2 legs, they're pretty long. You could probably walk around the island and find good shells in no time!
** '''Player:''' I suppose. How many do we need?
** '''Crab:''' As many different ones as you can find. Bring them here and I'll try them out.
** '''Player:''' Okay, then! I'll be back.
** '''Crab:''' See ya!
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|No.}}
** {{tbox|You decide against drinking from the bottle after all.}}
** {{tact|end}}

