==Obtaining Grimgnash's feather==
===Initial conversation with Grimgnash===
* '''Player:''' Uh...hello?
* '''Grimgnash:''' Human? Human come to Grimgnash? Grimgnash pleased! Grimgnash hungry!
* '''Player:''' No, wait! I didn't come to be eaten!
* '''Grimgnash:''' What human come for then? Grimgnash tired and hungry. Be quick, human. Answer Grimgnash before Grimgnash eats your legs!
* '''Player:''' Uh...uh...
* {{topt|I heard you were a great and mighty Griffin!}}
** '''Player:''' I heard you were a great and mighty Griffin!
** '''Grimgnash:''' Hah! Human hears right about Grimgnash! Grimgnash great and mighty griffin!
** '''Grimgnash:''' Now what human want? Grimgnash tired and can't sleep. Wolves make awful howling racket. Keep Grimgnash up all night.
** '''Player:''' Perhaps I can help you get to sleep in some way. Is there anything I can do?
** {{tact|below}}
* {{topt|I have come for your magic feather!}}
** '''Player:''' I have come for your magic feather!
** '''Grimgnash:''' Grimgnash's feather? Human come to steal feather? How dare human! Puny, scrawny little morsel! Grimgnash should eat human where human stands!
** {{tact|(Grimgnash attacks the player, and does a large amount of damage.)}}
** {{mes|Grimgnash lashes out at you and you recoil backwards in pain. You must be more careful what you say. Grimgnash could eat you at any moment!}}
** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|Do you have any quests for me?}}
** '''Player:''' Do you have any quests for me?
** '''Grimgnash:''' Quests? Quests? Human morsel wants a quest from Grimgnash? Human think Grimgnash is drunken dwarf or lazy ork? Grimgnash not gives quests!
** '''Grimgnash:''' Grimgnash tired and hungry and will eat little bite-size human!
** '''Player:''' Argh!
** {{tact|(Grimgnash attacks the player, and does a large amount of damage.)}}
** {{mes|Grimgnash lashes out at you and you recoil backwards in pain. You must be more careful what you say. Grimgnash could eat you at any moment!}}
** {{tact|end}}

===Using any item on Grimgnash===
* '''Player:''' Look what I've got!
* '''Grimgnash:''' Grargk! Grimgnash not care for stupid human things! Grimgnash hungry!
* {{tact|(Grimgnash attacks the player, and does a large amount of damage.)}}
* {{mes|Grimgnash lashes out at you and you recoil backwards in pain. You must be more careful what you say. Grimgnash could eat you at any moment!}}
* {{tact|end}}

===Putting Grimgnash to sleep===
* '''Grimgnash:''' Human toothpick dares to approach Grimgnash again after what human just say? Why human disturb Grimgnash? Human have death wish?
* '''Player:''' No, wait! I was wondering if perhaps I could help you at all. You said you couldn't sleep. Is there anything I can do?
* '''Grimgnash:''' Human help Grimgnash sleep? This good. Grimgnash let human help.
* '''Player:''' Ok. What can I do?
* '''Grimgnash:''' Hmm. When Grimgnash little grifflet, Grimgnash's mother-griff used to tell bedtime story to Grimgnash. That always help Grimgnash sleep.
* '''Player:''' So you want me to tell you a bed-time story, is that right?
* '''Grimgnash:''' Yes! Grimgnash like stories!
* '''Player:''' Right, well I'm sure that shouldn't be too hard. I know lots of stories!
