** '''Aris:''' And given that this is partly your fault, I fully expect your assistance in saving them.
** '''Player:''' MY fault??
** '''Aris:''' Yes. You were the one who provided the cook with the ingredients that he needed to allow the Culinaromancer to return to this dimension.
