* {{topt|You used to be a famous adventurer, didn't you?}}
** '''Player:''' You used to be a famous adventurer, didn't you?
** '''Wise Old Man:''' Heh heh! Yes, I suppose you could say that. But that was all quite a long time ago. I haven't been on what you'd call a 'quest' for a while.
** '''Player:''' Does that mean you'd be interested if someone asked for your help?
** '''Wise Old Man:''' Oh? What exactly had you in mind?
** '''Player:''' Herman Caranos of the Piscatoris Fishing Colony thinks he needs you to save his colony from a tribe of attacking sea trolls.
** '''Wise Old Man:''' Hmmm... so I haven't been forgotten... and the world once again is calling for my aid...
** '''Player:''' Well, it's just one man who smells of fish, not exactly the whole world...
** '''Wise Old Man:''' ... yet this could be the opportunity I've been waiting for...
** '''Player:''' ... yawn...
** {{qact|The player performs the Yawn emote}}
** '''Wise Old Man:''' ... but I'm a lot older than I used to be, do I still have the strength? Should I retire now, or can I do just one more quest?
** '''Player:''' If you're not feeling up to it, I'll leave you alone.
** '''Wise Old Man:''' Yes, I'll do it! This can be my final adventure, my last great quest. Saving this colony shall be my swan song.
** '''Player:''' Swan song?
** '''Wise Old Man:''' Legend tells us that a swan, before it dies, sings a song of outstanding beauty as a fitting conclusion to its graceful life. This adventure will be my swan song.
** '''Player:''' You're going to sing a song and then snuff it? Maybe I should tell Herman you've flipped...
** '''Wise Old Man:''' No, you ignoramus! I shall bring my adventuring days to a dramatic close by saving this colony!
** '''Player:''' Great. So long as you're not going to sing.
** '''Wise Old Man:''' Yes, that's right, I'm not going to sing. Anyway, I shall need some supplies from you.
** '''Player:''' Oh yes? What do you want?
** '''Wise Old Man:''' I'm rather short of runes. If you could fetch me 5 Blood runes, 10 Lava runes and 10 Mist runes, I'll be able to set off.
** {{tcond|If player already has them with them:}}
*** '''Player:''' I just happen to have those with me!
*** '''Wise Old Man:''' Gosh, you're very efficient!
*** '''Player:''' Sometimes I amaze even myself.
*** '''Wise Old Man:''' Ok, hand 'em over.
*** '''Player:''' Here you go...
*** '''Wise Old Man:''' Excellent. I'll see you outside the Colony. Don't forget to arm yourself - it could be dangerous!
*** {{qact|The Wise Old Man teleports away}}
*** {{tact|end}}
** {{tcond|If the player does not have the required runes:}}
*** '''Player:''' Right, 5 Blood runes, 10 Lava runes and 10 Mist runes.
*** {{tact|end}}
* {{topt|quest=No|More...}}

===Talking to the Wise Old Man again if the player didn't bring the runes before===
